  "goodToKnow": "Die Elektrizität is electricity, the scientific word; in everyday speech, Germans say der Strom: Strom sparen, die Stromrechnung. Das Elektrizitätswerk or E-Werk is a power station, and many club venues in old power stations are called E-Werk. Die Elektrik means the electrical system: Die Elektrik im Auto ist kaputt. From Greek elektron (amber). It has no plural."
